\title{Using the Julia Estimation Backend in CoTiMA2:\\
  Motivation, Workflow, and Practical Guidance}
%\author{CoTiMA development documentation}
\author{C. Dormann, \& $\widehat{\textnormal{C}}$. G. Petee}
